REACTIONS 
!
ALMe3 + O(S) => ALMe2(S) + 0.5C2H6           0.1   0.0   0.0
   STICK     ! 
2ALMe2(S) + O  => ALMeOALMe(S) + C2H6            1.0   0.0   0.0
   STICK     ! 
0.5ALMeOALMe(S) + O => O(S) + 0.5C2H6 + 0.5AL2O3(B)    1.0   0.0   0.0
   STICK     ! 
!
END